		(property "Function" "Generates the low-noise +5V_A rail from VSYS. IN pins 1-3 and PGFB (pin 7) are fed from VSYS_LDO through R201 1R (input isolation and LC damping, LT3045 Rev D p.18-19); IN capacitance is C202 10 uF X7R + C203 100 nF (p.18: stable with >= 4.7 uF at IN); C27 removed (S-8); EN/UV stays on VSYS; PG and fast start-up unused. Keep the SET/ILIM network and output caps at the pins."
